  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "X-EGO-CS",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for X-Ego-CS\n\t\n\nLinks:\n\nPaper\nGithub Codebase\nHomepage (comming soon)\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCross-Ego Demo (Pistol Round)\n\t\n\n\n  \n\n\nNote: This demo concats videos in a grid. The original datasets videos are from individual player POV recording.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nX-Ego-CS is a multi-agent gameplay video dataset for cross-egocentric multi-agent video understanding in Counter-Strike:2. It contains 124 hours of synchronized first-person gameplay footage captured from 45\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/wangyz1999/X-EGO-CS.",
